n zvráskavený riaditeľ otravné už na pohľad. \n/60%/(04.06.2026)","stars":3},{"author":"Stanley1983","text":"Jednotlivé scénky sú veľmi vtipné a chytro napísané, Steve Carell je borec a mám ho veľmi rád, ale iné postavy sú mi nesympatické a robia nemorálne rozhodnutia, sex je tu len ako šport a celkovo dianie je vlastne o ničom. Ale párkrát som sa dobre zasmial. Na Teda Lassa sa to ale nechytá ani z helikoptéry.(10.07.2026)","stars":3}],"vods":[{"platform":"HBO Max","url":"https://www.hbomax.com/cz/en/shows/rooster/c775cd23-a526-4c5f-a34c-30e831edf6e4"},{"platform":"Prime Video","url":"https://www.primevideo.com/detail/amzn1.dv.gti.81c0635f-0443-4b45-8e1c-98f8a436bec2"},{"platform":"SledovaniTV","url":"https://sledovanitv.cz/epg/event/HBO2:20260503ff894f108396eed8a55e55d340b0bdd0"},{"platform":"Lepší.TV","url":"https://www.lepsi.tv/top_tv/serial/kohout-online?utm_source=csfd&utm_content=csfd"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/1780846-kohout/prehled/","csfd_id":1780846,"root_id":1780846,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":2,"episode_count":20,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":7,"first_vod_date":"2026-03-08","last_vod_date":"2026-05-10","episodes":[{"season_no":1,"episode_no":1,"vod_date":"2026-03-08","title":"Uvolněte hnědý tuk (S01E01)","platforms":["HBO Max","Prime Video"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":2,"vod_date":"2026-03-15","title":"Kalhoty (S01E02)","platforms":["HBO Max","Prime Video"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":3,"vod_date":"2026-03-22","title":"Bílá velryba (S01E03)","platforms":["HBO Max","Prime Video"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":4,"vod_date":"2026-03-29","title":"Naštvaný, jako naštvaný člověk (S01E04)","platforms":["HBO Max","Prime Video"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":5,"vod_date":"2026-04-05","title":"Pan Špičkátor (S01E05)","platforms":["HBO Max","Prime Video","SledovaniTV"]},{"season_no":1,"episode_no":6,"vod_date":"2026-04-12","title":"Policejní ostříž (S01E0